WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.960
I don’t know, it has been a while.

00:00:02.585 --> 00:00:04.212
I have traveled around the world.

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:08.133
Despite that, it’s hard to tell you the truth.

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:11.469
I’m afraid to break your heart.

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:15.348
I don’t know if you will still love me...

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:19.185
once you know who I truly am.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.480
I’m sorry that you’re being pulled into this...

00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:25.108
but I swear on my life...

00:00:25.108 --> 00:00:26.609
that I’ll never let any person...

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:31.114
hurt you or the kids.

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:35.910
That was crazy sexy.

